for supporting PBS.

00:09:36.600 --> 00:09:38.150
Was that your great-grandmother

00:09:38.150 --> 00:09:39.880
keeping the family together?

00:09:39.880 --> 00:09:41.500
Was that your great-grandfather

00:09:41.500 --> 00:09:43.550
paving the way for change?

00:09:43.550 --> 00:09:47.220
Did they brave Mother Nature
and walk away stronger?

00:09:47.220 --> 00:09:51.180
Did they face the unknown
with resolve and triumph?

00:09:51.180 --> 00:09:53.860
There is strength in every family story,

00:09:53.860 --> 00:09:56.760
and Ancestry can help
you learn about yours.

